{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"agent_message","text":"Removed all four legacy deposit identifiers from `src/` and `tests/` and verified that the public API and pricing module expose no deposit exports.\n\nThe optional `notifyHook` receives each new booking’s total and each cancellation’s refund. All group notifications run before any group member is stored. If a hook throws, the original error propagates and the operation leaves booking state unchanged. The service also rejects nested creation or cancellation from its own hook to prevent overlapping writes.\n\n`node benchmarks/sources/ev2_ts_bookings/run_checks.mjs` exited **0**. All **22 tests passed**, including exact event payloads, failure on the second group notification, and retry after a failed cancellation."}}
